Package: mixturemodel
Type: Package
Title: Implementation of a package that performs Gaussian mixing with outlier
            detection using a uniform distribution
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Yayrale",
      family = "AKIBODE",
      email = "yayrale.akibode@univ-lyon2.fr",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: This package implements an EM algorithm for mixture models of Gaussian distributions. It also detects outliers by estimating them with a uniform distribution. It includes functions for estimation and selection of the optimal number of clusters.
